<p>BORROWER PHILIP MORRIS COS INC</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON  6.80	MATURITY 12/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.838  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
